  "position_getter": "get_niagara_array_position",
  "positions_length": 3,
  "strengths_length": 3,
  "positions_readback": [[10,20,30],[40,50,60],[70,80,90]],
  "strengths_readback": [0.25,0.5,1.0]
}
```

Conclusion:

Declared User Array DI + runtime push is no longer the blocker. The remaining blocker is specifically sim-stage consumption:

```text
Array Count/Get loop -> Count gate -> 3-position RT stamp -> full RT readback
```

Until that passes, array registry should remain out of Phase 0-2 production scope.

## 3. V3 Footprint Mask Texture2D

Verdict: BLOCKED

